.TH HEIMDALL 1 "October 2026" "Heimdall 2.0.0-m6c" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
heimdall \- policy-first Linux terminal assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B heimdall
.RI [ options ] " goal ..."
.br
.B heimdall
.B --cmd
.RI command
.br
.B heimdall
.B ping
.br
.B heimdall
.B mode show
.br
.B sudo heimdall
.B mode set
.BR sandbox | direct | hybrid
.SH DESCRIPTION
Heimdall proposes or runs one simple command at a time through a local policy
daemon, heimdald. The daemon classifies commands, returns ALLOW, ASK, DENY, or
DEFER, and writes an audit log before execution is authorized.
.PP
Approved commands run in direct mode or in a Bubblewrap sandbox according to
the active policy mode. The client never reads the daemon HMAC secret or the
policy file directly. Project memory can provide prior context to the local LLM,
but daemon policy still authorizes every command. The client uses
terminal-width-aware bordered panels for its banner and verdict displays.
.SH COMMON COMMANDS
.TP
.B heimdall ping
Check that the daemon is reachable.
.TP
.B heimdall mode show
Show the active default mode plus domain and flag overrides.
.TP
.B heimdall doctor
Check daemon reachability, install paths, Git state, and LLM endpoint health.
.TP
.B sudo heimdall-update
Fast-forward the installed Git checkout, reinstall, and restart the daemon.
.TP
.B sudo heimdall mode set sandbox
Change daemon mode. Requires root and the confirmation phrase.
.TP
.B heimdall --cmd "cat /etc/hostname"
Classify and run one command through the daemon.
.TP
.B heimdall --cmd "python3 script.py" --dry-run
Preview policy, scanner, and sandbox routing without executing.
.TP
.B heimdall "list all listening TCP sockets"
Ask the configured local LLM for one command at a time.
.TP
.B heimdall --project ABC "continue the audit"
Use project-scoped memory from ~/.heimdall/projects/ABC.
.TP
.B heimdall --temp "inspect this once"
Run without writing session or project history.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --cmd COMMAND
Skip the LLM and submit COMMAND directly to the daemon.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Show the verdict and intended execution mode without launching a command.
.TP
.B --execute-on-windows
Opt into direct execution on Windows. Windows defaults to dry-run.
.TP
.B --socket PATH
Use a specific Unix socket.
.TP
.B --tcp HOST:PORT
Use a loopback TCP daemon endpoint for development.
.TP
.B --dev
Use the development daemon endpoint.
.TP
.B --llm-url URL
Use another OpenAI-compatible chat/completions endpoint.
.TP
.B --llm-model MODEL
Use another model name, for example heimdall-v1.
.TP
.B --max-steps N
Limit agent loop steps.
.TP
.B --timeout SECONDS
Limit each command execution.
.TP
.B --project NAME
Load and save project-scoped command context under ~/.heimdall/projects/NAME.
.TP
.B --temp
Temporary chat. Do not write session logs or project memory.
.TP
.B --no-history
Do not write the per-user session JSONL log.
.TP
.B --auto-approve
Accept ASK verdicts silently for this invocation. Requires policy opt-in via
allow_auto_approve and may require the configured phrase. DENY is never
overridden.
.TP
.B --ascii
Use ASCII status symbols and spinner frames.
.TP
.B --no-color
Disable color output.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/heimdall/safety.yaml
Root-owned policy file.
.TP
.I /run/heimdall/bifrost.sock
Production daemon socket.
.TP
.I /var/lib/heimdall/history/
Daemon hash-chained audit logs.
.TP
.I ~/.heimdall/session-YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl
Best-effort per-user session replay log.
.TP
.I ~/.heimdall/projects/NAME/memory.jsonl
Project-scoped memory used as LLM context unless --temp is set.
.TP
.I /etc/heimdall/mode
Persisted default mode.
.SH INSTALLATION
Install or reconfigure with:
.PP
.B sudo ./heimdall-install.sh --mode hybrid
.PP
After installation, reconfigure with:
.PP
.B sudo heimdall-install --mode sandbox
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Connection, daemon, or LLM error.
.TP
.B 2
Policy denial or invalid CLI input.
.TP
.B 3
Confirmation declined or phrase mismatch.
.TP
.B 4
Execution blocked by authorization checks.
.TP
.B 5
Loop limit, scanner block, or client rate limit.
.TP
.B 124
Command timeout.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR heimdald.service (5),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR bubblewrap (1)
